LicenseRef-UCGR-RE — source-specific notices

This identifier records the supplied UCGR-RE package's notices and the
permission for this Steel Tide port. It is not an SPDX standard license.
The original material is not relicensed under the repository's default CC-BY-4.0 terms.

Original project: UCGR-RE v4.3 / 巨浪 v1.29.6 信息战 20261004
Original credited developer: GY工作室 / GY Studio
Current player group in the supplied title: 1106943912

Permission record: on 2026-10-16 the maintainer confirmed, "We got the
permission from the original studio." The Steel Tide port proceeds with
that studio permission. Original ownership and source notices are retained.

The supplied mod-info.txt contains this Chinese notice (verbatim):

允许上传其他平台，但须标明群号，禁止使用模组进行误导性/混淆性宣传 模组为架空世界线，同现实政治不存在任何关联

For reference, its meaning is: uploading to other platforms is permitted
provided the group number is shown; misleading or confusing promotion is
prohibited; the mod is set in a fictional world unrelated to real politics.
The original Chinese wording and the complete original notice are retained
in notices/mod-info.txt. The translation does not expand that notice.

The supplied PUB and RES notices each state (verbatim):

授权信息:TCS工作室已授权！
2023.1.20

These notices say TCS Studio authorization was given on 2023-01-20. They do
not state its scope or onward reuse terms. Exact copies are retained in
notices/PUB-copyright.info and notices/RES-copyright.info.

The confirmed studio permission covers this port. It does not relicense
the original material under CC-BY-4.0 or establish a general open-source
license. The LicenseRef label preserves the source-specific terms and
original ownership.

The PPSH bonus units remain outside the MVP selection as deferred content,
not as a hold for missing studio permission. Their source directory contains
an empty file named 未经允许禁止使用.txt (use without permission prohibited);
that filename is retained in the source audit.

See CREDITS.md for attribution and COMPATIBILITY.md for source evidence.
